WEBVTT

01:40.470 --> 01:44.220
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.080 --> 01:47.240
[Episode 27]

01:59.430 --> 02:00.230
Yuanzhong.

02:02.400 --> 02:03.200
Yuanzhong.

02:04.950 --> 02:05.760
Yuanzhong!

02:06.150 --> 02:07.280
Where are you?

02:08.840 --> 02:09.630
Yuanzhong!

02:11.310 --> 02:12.120
Yuanzhong!

02:20.550 --> 02:21.340
Yuanzhong.

02:23.190 --> 02:24.000
Yuanzhong.

02:26.630 --> 02:27.430
Yuanzhong.

02:29.800 --> 02:30.590
Yuanzhong!

03:13.470 --> 03:15.520
Left... A little more to the left.

03:15.920 --> 03:16.840
A little more to the left.

03:17.240 --> 03:18.430
Be careful.

03:20.030 --> 03:20.840
Tanyin!

03:22.560 --> 03:23.430
You're awake.

03:24.360 --> 03:25.680
What are you guys doing?

03:27.000 --> 03:28.190
We're fixing the window frame.

03:28.680 --> 03:29.910
Good morning, Ji Tanyin.

03:36.280 --> 03:37.079
Tanyin.

03:37.280 --> 03:38.030
Do you know that

03:38.030 --> 03:39.750
you nearly scared me to death that day?

03:39.750 --> 03:40.910
You were completely motionless.

03:41.079 --> 03:42.310
The doctor said you were dead

03:42.310 --> 03:42.840
and insisted that we

03:42.840 --> 03:44.120
go find a coffin shop.

03:44.140 --> 03:45.120
I was so angry

03:45.120 --> 03:46.520
that I scolded him and drove him away.

03:46.840 --> 03:47.710
He said he would

03:47.710 --> 03:48.890
never treat us again.

03:48.910 --> 03:50.190
Who needs him to treat us anyway?

03:51.240 --> 03:52.190
Sorry.

03:52.829 --> 03:54.040
I made you worry.

03:54.560 --> 03:55.470
Tanyin.

03:56.190 --> 03:57.750
I never believed you would die.

03:57.840 --> 03:58.680
How could such a nice

03:58.680 --> 03:59.680
and healthy person

03:59.680 --> 04:00.870
possibly die like that?

04:01.360 --> 04:03.250
I wanted to go find another doctor,

04:03.430 --> 04:04.560
but they wouldn't let me.

04:06.520 --> 04:07.710
I'm really fine.

04:08.410 --> 04:09.220
I just...

04:12.080 --> 04:13.590
I just held my breath for a while.

04:13.970 --> 04:15.430
Was it breath-holding?

04:16.600 --> 04:17.920
How dangerous that was.

04:17.920 --> 04:19.560
What if something really happens next time?

04:19.630 --> 04:20.800
I promise you

04:20.920 --> 04:22.190
it won't happen again.

04:23.000 --> 04:24.270
That's more like it.

04:24.600 --> 04:25.240
You...

04:25.240 --> 04:25.800
By the way,

04:26.000 --> 04:27.270
what's Qian Lin doing?

04:27.510 --> 04:28.740
Why don't you go check on him?

04:28.950 --> 04:29.750
Qian Lin?

04:30.750 --> 04:31.960
Why should I check on him?

04:35.510 --> 04:38.000
I suddenly have a craving for sugar cake.

04:38.750 --> 04:39.710
With sesame stuffing.

04:40.070 --> 04:41.460
Could you go buy some for me?

04:41.600 --> 04:42.600
Now?

04:50.430 --> 04:51.890
Looks like someone has something

04:51.920 --> 04:53.070
to say in private.

04:53.430 --> 04:54.240
Alright.

04:54.270 --> 04:55.920
Then I'll go buy the sugar cake.

04:56.450 --> 04:57.970
Sesame sugar cake, date sugar cake,

04:57.990 --> 04:58.909
sugarcane sugar cake,

04:58.940 --> 05:00.430
or whatever sugar cake, I guess.

05:03.600 --> 05:05.120
I have something to tell you.

05:06.480 --> 05:07.270
Go ahead.

05:10.430 --> 05:11.240
Before,

05:12.000 --> 05:13.070
I doubted you

05:13.400 --> 05:14.310
and tested you.

05:15.630 --> 05:16.950
That was all my fault.

05:18.480 --> 05:19.720
I argued with you

05:20.240 --> 05:21.430
and even raised my hand against you.

05:21.680 --> 05:23.310
It was a terrible mistake.

05:24.240 --> 05:26.160
From now on, I won't do it again.

05:27.390 --> 05:28.920
Can you forgive me?

05:34.360 --> 05:35.159
Ji Tanyin.

05:36.510 --> 05:38.020
Something big happened that night.

05:39.220 --> 05:40.190
What happened?

05:40.720 --> 05:41.920
Do you remember

05:42.310 --> 05:43.870
the places you said you wanted to go?

05:44.110 --> 05:44.920
You said

05:45.000 --> 05:45.680
you wanted to go

05:45.680 --> 05:47.070
to those places with me.

05:50.240 --> 05:51.430
That travel journal

05:51.430 --> 05:53.070
was accidentally burned by me.

05:54.270 --> 05:55.870
But I've transcribed them all

05:55.870 --> 05:56.920
based on my memory

05:56.920 --> 05:58.240
and what you said.

05:58.240 --> 05:58.950
I'll read it to you,

05:58.950 --> 05:59.830
and you can check if it's complete.

06:00.150 --> 06:00.960
Sure.

06:08.950 --> 06:10.240
"I was to the east of Tanlu Pavilion,

06:10.630 --> 06:11.600
gazing at Chizhou,

06:12.120 --> 06:13.270
delighted by the sight.

06:13.750 --> 06:15.870
We crossed Di River and Wan Creek.

06:16.160 --> 06:17.190
After passing through some lonely lands,

06:17.600 --> 06:18.720
we drank sweet wine aplenty.

06:19.040 --> 06:20.360
I reached the summit of the high mountain

06:20.600 --> 06:21.750
and the source of the river.

06:22.390 --> 06:23.510
Only then did I rest."

06:26.370 --> 06:27.940
Yes, it did contain these.

06:29.240 --> 06:30.040
You said

06:30.360 --> 06:31.510
there was a poet

06:31.830 --> 06:32.950
who once, by chance,

06:33.190 --> 06:35.240
arrived at the scenic spots of Chizhou.

06:35.720 --> 06:37.920
So he crossed the Xiao River,

06:38.270 --> 06:40.190
reached the peak of West Mountain,

06:40.480 --> 06:41.950
and beheld the breathtaking landscape.

06:42.120 --> 06:44.360
He experienced the charm of mountains and waters,

06:44.480 --> 06:46.680
and achieved a state of unity with nature.

06:49.520 --> 06:50.390
And there's this one.

06:50.560 --> 06:52.630
This is about local customs.

06:52.720 --> 06:55.120
They have a custom of drinking on ice beds.

06:55.430 --> 06:56.560
"It's rare to find travelers here,

06:56.830 --> 06:57.950
enjoying themselves so much that they forget to return.

06:58.290 --> 06:59.360
People feast and drink,

06:59.750 --> 07:01.070
singing loudly on the ice beds,

07:01.480 --> 07:02.680
reciting poetry and drinking,

07:02.770 --> 07:03.940
with snow as their companion,

07:04.120 --> 07:05.120
in perfect harmony."

07:06.510 --> 07:09.360
You also mentioned a place

07:09.480 --> 07:10.480
where many years ago,

07:10.830 --> 07:12.360
an unusual natural phenomenon appeared.

07:13.070 --> 07:13.950
In the long night,

07:13.950 --> 07:15.830
a beam of five-colored light appeared,

07:16.270 --> 07:17.430
resembling a dragon or a snake,

07:17.750 --> 07:18.830
and the whole space was lit up.

07:19.000 --> 07:20.120
It didn't go away until half a month later.

07:20.510 --> 07:21.480
The sky there

07:21.680 --> 07:24.190
has been colorful ever since.

07:25.120 --> 07:25.920
How was it?

07:26.300 --> 07:27.300
Did I cover everything?

07:27.390 --> 07:28.680
Is there anything I missed?

07:28.680 --> 07:29.430
No.

07:38.070 --> 07:38.870
Ji Tanyin.

07:40.040 --> 07:41.630
I'm giving you an answer seriously now.

07:42.630 --> 07:44.120
I want to go with you

07:44.830 --> 07:46.720
to the places recorded in the notebook,

07:47.430 --> 07:49.190
and the places that haven't been recorded.

07:50.240 --> 07:52.390
Everything that's interesting,

07:52.920 --> 07:53.870
unknown,

07:54.800 --> 07:55.950
unseen,

07:56.640 --> 07:57.870
and worth experiencing,

07:58.720 --> 08:00.230
I want to experience them all with you.

08:00.920 --> 08:02.560
I hope we can take our time and experience them together.

08:07.270 --> 08:08.070
Yuanzhong.

08:11.400 --> 08:12.480
Thank you for your hard work.

08:14.890 --> 08:15.890
Writing a few words

08:16.570 --> 08:17.810
isn't hard at all.

10:00.320 --> 10:01.720
Taihe's divine body has disintegrated.

10:01.740 --> 10:02.980
I'm powerless to reverse the situation.

10:03.630 --> 10:04.720
Only this map

10:04.740 --> 10:06.220
can keep you barely alive,

10:06.250 --> 10:07.890
temporarily preventing you from dissolving into the universe.

10:08.630 --> 10:10.120
What on earth happened?

10:10.270 --> 10:11.200
Why did Taihe's divine body

10:11.200 --> 10:12.470
suddenly collapse?

10:12.750 --> 10:14.030
Because the other me

10:14.280 --> 10:16.370
is about to cease to exist.

10:16.450 --> 10:17.420
The other you?

10:17.790 --> 10:18.600
What do you mean?

10:18.870 --> 10:20.360
During the war between gods and demons,

10:20.630 --> 10:21.440
Taihe and I

10:21.440 --> 10:23.150
fought to the very last moment.

10:23.390 --> 10:25.320
We were both about to perish in the universe.

10:25.510 --> 10:27.480
My body was completely shattered,

10:27.690 --> 10:29.570
and Taihe's primordial spirit was also dispersed.

10:30.000 --> 10:31.910
I took the opportunity to enter Taihe's body,

10:32.160 --> 10:33.880
intending to possess his body.

10:34.110 --> 10:36.380
So Taihe cut off his left hand?

10:36.690 --> 10:37.490
Yes.

10:38.080 --> 10:38.840
In order to

10:38.840 --> 10:40.320
prevent me from invading and possessing him,

10:40.550 --> 10:41.670
Taihe recklessly

10:41.670 --> 10:43.240
cut off the Divine Left Hand

10:43.240 --> 10:44.480
and threw it into the mortal realm,

10:44.660 --> 10:46.420
splitting my primordial spirit in two.

10:46.720 --> 10:48.370
He also severed the celestial ladder.

10:49.200 --> 10:52.080
Since then, my primordial spirit has been incomplete.

10:52.100 --> 10:53.620
Half of it fell into the mortal realm,

10:53.650 --> 10:55.800
while the other half barely survived in the Divine Realm.

10:56.000 --> 10:57.360
I couldn't be reborn.

10:57.590 --> 10:59.590
I could only lie dormant in this body,

10:59.700 --> 11:00.980
waiting for the right moment

11:01.270 --> 11:02.720
to make my move again.

11:03.360 --> 11:05.200
I know all of this that you've said.

11:05.600 --> 11:06.960
But for all these years,

11:07.200 --> 11:08.000
Taihe's divine body

11:08.000 --> 11:09.150
has remained intact.

11:09.840 --> 11:11.550
Why has it been showing frequent anomalies recently,

11:11.720 --> 11:12.840
until it completely disappeared

11:12.840 --> 11:13.840
into the Luofu Sea?

11:14.030 --> 11:15.600
Because Yuanzhong's inner malice

11:15.600 --> 11:16.600
has been decreasing.

11:16.640 --> 11:17.760
It's becoming less and less.

11:18.010 --> 11:20.200
The Divine Left Hand has been lost in the Mortal Realm for years

11:20.230 --> 11:21.390
and has been severely damaged.

11:21.750 --> 11:22.790
That half of my primordial spirit

11:22.790 --> 11:24.150
has become very weak

11:24.150 --> 11:25.910
and needs to feed on human malice.

11:26.360 --> 11:28.000
The High Priest of the Youhu Clan

11:28.200 --> 11:30.360
was indeed the most resentful and world-weary person

11:30.360 --> 11:31.480
in this universe in the past,

11:31.480 --> 11:33.000
with the strongest malice.

11:33.320 --> 11:34.320
But now,

11:34.560 --> 11:36.330
his malice is becoming less and less.

11:36.880 --> 11:38.760
When he truly becomes wholeheartedly good,

11:38.780 --> 11:40.420
that other half of my primordial spirit

11:40.450 --> 11:42.000
will completely disappear.

11:42.120 --> 11:43.750
I will cease to exist as well.

11:44.180 --> 11:45.530
Our grand plan

11:45.610 --> 11:47.250
will be impossible to complete.

11:48.050 --> 11:49.720
We must kill him immediately.

11:50.080 --> 11:50.870
Hannv.

11:51.120 --> 11:52.840
Go and retrieve the Divine Left Hand.

11:52.920 --> 11:54.230
We can't wait any longer.

11:58.840 --> 12:01.370
[City Lord's Mansion]

12:07.150 --> 12:08.080
Hushan ginseng

12:08.150 --> 12:09.790
is considered a specialty of Fangwai Mountain.

12:09.790 --> 12:11.030
It has the remarkable effect of nourishing blood and replenishing qi,

12:11.030 --> 12:12.480
as well as benefiting yin and strengthening bones.

12:12.500 --> 12:14.000
Please kindly accept this, Young Mistress Dai.

12:14.310 --> 12:16.200
I've never seen

12:16.230 --> 12:17.600
such a big Hushan ginseng before.

12:18.750 --> 12:20.240
Why are you presenting such a valuable gift?

12:20.790 --> 12:22.790
Since Mr. Tanghua got injured,

12:22.790 --> 12:24.360
he's been taken care of here at the City Lord's Mansion.

12:24.440 --> 12:25.510
Countless precious medicinal herbs

12:25.510 --> 12:26.790
like this must have been used.

12:27.320 --> 12:29.360
I am merely acting on behalf of the Elders of our clan

12:29.360 --> 12:30.630
to present this humble gift

12:30.630 --> 12:32.030
as a token of our appreciation.

12:33.030 --> 12:34.390
You should take it back.

12:36.750 --> 12:38.750
He was injured while saving me

12:38.790 --> 12:40.480
by those vicious War Demons.

12:41.030 --> 12:42.080
Treating him at my mansion

12:42.080 --> 12:43.480
is only right and proper.

12:44.150 --> 12:44.750
I'm already grateful that the Youhu Clan

12:44.750 --> 12:46.200
hasn't blamed me for this.

12:46.200 --> 12:47.200
How could I

12:47.630 --> 12:49.200
be so shameless

12:49.200 --> 12:50.390
as to accept a thank-you gift?

12:50.960 --> 12:52.150
Although what you said might be true,

12:52.480 --> 12:53.270
if you

12:53.270 --> 12:55.030
insist on not accepting this,

12:55.480 --> 12:56.480
when I return,

12:56.750 --> 12:58.360
I'm afraid I won't be able to explain to the Elders.

12:59.000 --> 13:00.150
I've made up my mind.

13:00.320 --> 13:01.270
I absolutely cannot accept it.

13:03.790 --> 13:05.000
Please, Young Mistress Dai,

13:05.000 --> 13:06.320
don't put me in a difficult position.

13:06.620 --> 13:08.310
It's you who shouldn't be putting me in a difficult position.

13:09.120 --> 13:10.360
What's so difficult?

13:13.550 --> 13:14.600
Greetings, Young Master.

13:16.000 --> 13:16.790
Young Master.

13:16.960 --> 13:17.750
Jiuguang.

13:18.240 --> 13:19.240
It's been a few days since I last saw you.

13:19.260 --> 13:20.730
You seem to have lost quite some weight.

13:22.060 --> 13:22.740
Really?

13:24.270 --> 13:25.600
But your complexion, Young Master,

13:25.600 --> 13:26.560
has improved a lot.

13:28.670 --> 13:29.910
Thanks to Miss Zhi Dai's

13:29.910 --> 13:30.790
attentive care,

13:31.390 --> 13:33.200
I feel my injuries are almost healed.

13:35.790 --> 13:37.440
I, Jiuguang, want to thank you again, Young Mistress Dai.

13:38.240 --> 13:39.840
There's no need for such formalities.

13:41.440 --> 13:42.550
Speaking of which,

13:42.870 --> 13:44.630
the Elders of our clan asked me

13:44.630 --> 13:46.080
to bring a small gift.

13:46.080 --> 13:46.960
But Young Mistress Dai

13:46.960 --> 13:48.510
is reluctant to accept it.

13:52.240 --> 13:53.030
Is that so?

13:53.910 --> 13:55.240
We lack nothing at our mansion.

13:55.320 --> 13:56.790
I've already appreciated your kind gesture.

13:59.270 --> 14:00.080
This...

14:00.320 --> 14:01.870
You two, master and servant, haven't seen each other for days.

14:01.870 --> 14:02.840
Have a good chat.

14:02.960 --> 14:03.910
I still have some matters to attend to,

14:03.960 --> 14:05.080
so I'll take my leave now.

14:06.900 --> 14:08.380
Yuying, come with me for a walk.

14:09.240 --> 14:09.900
Yes.

14:18.790 --> 14:20.440
Did you tell the Elders

14:20.750 --> 14:22.080
about my injury?

14:22.390 --> 14:23.270
Of course not.

14:23.600 --> 14:24.720
Without your approval, Young Master,

14:24.870 --> 14:26.270
how could I send any message at will?

14:27.870 --> 14:28.870
Then this ginseng...

14:29.910 --> 14:30.900
If it weren't for this,

14:31.630 --> 14:32.600
how would the two of us

14:33.030 --> 14:35.000
have had the chance to be alone like this?

14:37.270 --> 14:38.720
Have you perhaps discovered something?

14:44.750 --> 14:46.200
You should go and help Xue.

14:46.790 --> 14:47.390
Alright.

14:47.390 --> 14:48.160
Then you sit for a while.

14:53.210 --> 14:54.450
Was it him who hurt you?

14:54.630 --> 14:55.510
No, it wasn't.

14:55.510 --> 14:57.030
I know he's been possessed.

14:57.030 --> 14:58.360
I can see it.

14:58.360 --> 14:59.720
What do you think you've seen?

14:59.720 --> 15:00.930
Stop talking nonsense.

15:01.080 --> 15:02.670
Your magic source has been destroyed.

15:02.670 --> 15:03.670
If he hears you,

15:03.670 --> 15:05.150
you won't be able to beat him later.

15:05.630 --> 15:07.270
He couldn't beat me even before his magic source was destroyed.

15:10.750 --> 15:11.750
Your magic source got destroyed?

15:12.170 --> 15:12.970
By whom?

15:16.050 --> 15:16.860
Me?

15:17.600 --> 15:18.390
When was that?

15:19.030 --> 15:20.120
How come I don't remember?

15:20.390 --> 15:20.960
You...

15:20.960 --> 15:21.870
Alright, alright.

15:21.870 --> 15:22.910
Let's eat.

15:22.910 --> 15:23.750
Stop talking.

15:28.790 --> 15:29.670
It's a feast, isn't it?

15:29.910 --> 15:30.530
Come on.

15:34.720 --> 15:35.720
I'm exhausted.

15:37.840 --> 15:39.480
Today is truly a great day.

15:40.190 --> 15:41.040
Is this all?

15:42.550 --> 15:43.360
Where's the wine?

15:44.000 --> 15:45.000
Tanyin is sick,

15:45.000 --> 15:46.510
so we'll skip the wine today.

15:46.630 --> 15:47.870
We'll have soup instead.

15:47.870 --> 15:49.600
Let's all raise our bowls

15:49.600 --> 15:50.510
to celebrate.

15:50.910 --> 15:52.000
What are we celebrating?

15:53.270 --> 15:55.840
Celebrating that Tanyin has woken up,

15:55.860 --> 15:57.910
and that the High Priest of the Youhu Clan

15:57.940 --> 15:59.100
has come to visit our home.

16:09.030 --> 16:10.320
Come on, Tanyin, try this.

16:10.320 --> 16:11.120
See if it's good.

16:11.790 --> 16:12.600
Here.

16:19.440 --> 16:20.230
High Priest.

16:20.260 --> 16:21.120
Do you like

16:21.120 --> 16:22.030
our Tanyin?

16:29.520 --> 16:30.790
How did you figure that out?

16:31.720 --> 16:32.670
Do you even need to ask?

16:32.670 --> 16:33.910
Isn't it obvious?

16:37.440 --> 16:39.150
Did you have a fight

16:39.300 --> 16:40.570
with Tanyin a few days ago?

16:42.030 --> 16:43.630
Don't fight anymore in the future.

16:43.630 --> 16:45.510
We, as her family, won't allow it.

16:45.670 --> 16:46.260
Okay.

16:46.790 --> 16:47.750
I promise you.

16:47.750 --> 16:48.390
Good.

16:48.410 --> 16:50.210
Let's have another drink then.

16:50.240 --> 16:50.910
Alright.

16:51.390 --> 16:52.070
Come on.

16:57.670 --> 16:58.480
Tanyin.

16:59.000 --> 17:00.630
If the High Priest wants to take care of you,

17:01.000 --> 17:02.750
does that mean he'll live here, too?

17:04.349 --> 17:05.680
I can live here.

17:05.680 --> 17:06.400
It's just,

17:06.550 --> 17:07.349
which room should I stay in?

17:07.349 --> 17:08.579
You can stay in Qian Lin's room.

17:08.609 --> 17:09.780
Qian Lin can stay in the woodshed.

17:11.349 --> 17:12.440
I'll go, okay?

17:12.440 --> 17:13.270
I'll stay in the woodshed.

17:13.270 --> 17:14.109
Calm down.

17:14.109 --> 17:14.720
Sit down, sit down.

17:14.720 --> 17:15.589
Don't be angry.

17:15.589 --> 17:16.920
I'll punish myself with a drink, okay?

17:17.880 --> 17:18.750
I'll drink as punishment.

17:26.720 --> 17:28.240
Peace is really good.

17:28.860 --> 17:29.730
You see,

17:30.590 --> 17:32.070
as long as everyone can sit down

17:32.070 --> 17:33.110
and have a meal together,

17:33.200 --> 17:34.640
there's nothing that can't be resolved.

17:34.640 --> 17:36.160
Whether it's the Youhu Clan,

17:36.160 --> 17:37.830
the War Demon, or the human race,

17:37.830 --> 17:39.070
we can all get along, right?

17:39.750 --> 17:40.790
Well said.

17:40.920 --> 17:41.830
It's worth having another bowl.

17:41.830 --> 17:43.160
Come on, let's have another bowl.

17:43.160 --> 17:43.920
Cheers.

17:43.920 --> 17:44.550
Cheers.

17:58.240 --> 18:00.110
This War Demon here had his magic source destroyed,

18:00.150 --> 18:01.460
yet he's still got quite an appetite.

18:02.000 --> 18:03.240
Is it because the stomach and the magic source

18:03.240 --> 18:04.310
are far apart in your body?

18:05.110 --> 18:06.000
Alright, alright.

18:06.000 --> 18:07.310
It's such a good day today.

18:07.310 --> 18:08.400
Let's have a good time, shall we?

18:08.400 --> 18:09.030
Come on, come on.

18:09.030 --> 18:09.680
Cheers.

18:09.830 --> 18:11.400
Right, let's have another drink.

18:11.430 --> 18:12.880
To our reunion.

18:12.880 --> 18:13.790
Year after year.

18:13.790 --> 18:14.600
Year after year.

18:14.620 --> 18:15.160
Cheers.

18:15.270 --> 18:16.440
Cheers.

18:21.160 --> 18:23.200
That's right. That's the spirit.

18:29.640 --> 18:30.630
♫The wind blows♫

18:30.660 --> 18:32.420
♫It blows away the shadows of the clouds♫

18:32.460 --> 18:34.110
♫It makes the moon seem even brighter♫

18:34.140 --> 18:38.320
♫It makes me wake up from a dream♫

18:38.340 --> 18:39.570
♫The wind blows♫

18:39.600 --> 18:41.190
♫It reddens my eyes♫

18:41.210 --> 18:43.210
♫It warms the promise we made♫

18:43.320 --> 18:46.850
♫In the wind, we gently♫

18:46.870 --> 18:50.650
♫Drift into a better place♫

19:00.110 --> 19:00.920
Young Mistress.

19:02.880 --> 19:03.790
What did the doctor say?

19:04.030 --> 19:04.880
Young Mistress.

19:05.400 --> 19:06.750
The doctor said he has fully recovered

19:06.750 --> 19:08.200
and can leave at any time.

19:08.920 --> 19:09.720
However,

19:10.160 --> 19:11.880
Mr. Tanghua just told me

19:12.160 --> 19:14.110
he plans to stay for another day or two before leaving.

19:14.130 --> 19:14.930
He said there's no rush.

19:19.000 --> 19:21.000
One more person in the mansion won't make a difference.

19:21.790 --> 19:23.200
It's fine if he stays for a couple more days.

19:23.640 --> 19:24.320
Yes.

19:37.190 --> 19:38.840
Stay for another day or two...

19:51.000 --> 19:51.640
I noticed you didn't eat much

19:51.640 --> 19:52.680
at dinner.

19:53.270 --> 19:54.550
I've cut some fruit for you.

19:55.090 --> 19:55.680
Here.

20:00.350 --> 20:01.440
I didn't eat much

20:01.440 --> 20:02.550
all because of you.

20:02.590 --> 20:03.480
Couldn't you have said

20:03.480 --> 20:04.750
a bit less to Qian Lin?

20:05.110 --> 20:06.030
He's already been through

20:06.030 --> 20:06.920
so much.

20:07.110 --> 20:08.000
He's not in a good mood,

20:08.160 --> 20:09.480
and he doesn't know how to express himself well.

20:10.550 --> 20:11.970
You're not worried about me talking to him.

20:12.510 --> 20:13.990
You're just worried I might lecture him, right?

20:14.550 --> 20:15.270
Can't you just

20:15.270 --> 20:16.440
do it for my sake?

20:17.920 --> 20:18.560
Alright.

20:22.490 --> 20:23.290
What are you doing?

20:24.480 --> 20:25.790
I'm carefully observing what "your sake" looks like.

20:40.480 --> 20:41.400
Alright, alright.

20:41.400 --> 20:42.830
I- I got it.

20:45.000 --> 20:46.210
Here, have another one.

20:56.280 --> 20:58.170
Days like this are really nice.

20:59.200 --> 21:00.000
Ji Tanyin.

21:01.430 --> 21:02.910
You'll always be by my side, right?

22:00.200 --> 22:01.440
Now that

22:01.830 --> 22:03.880
we've created the perfect War Demon,

22:04.710 --> 22:08.190
it's time for the High Priest of the Youhu Clan

22:08.550 --> 22:10.310
to pay for his crimes in blood.

23:16.920 --> 23:17.720
It's me.

23:17.880 --> 23:18.680
Tanghua?

23:23.830 --> 23:24.960
What are you doing here?

23:25.190 --> 23:26.630
This is not the place for a detailed conversation.

23:26.720 --> 23:27.610
Let's talk after we get back.

23:28.330 --> 23:29.130
Cut the crap.

23:29.150 --> 23:30.600
If you don't talk, I'll shout for help.

23:32.720 --> 23:33.510
Go ahead and shout.

23:34.440 --> 23:35.720
This is Zhi Yue's study.

23:35.720 --> 23:36.720
It's highly confidential.

23:37.070 --> 23:38.350
Do you know what will happen if I call for someone?

23:38.370 --> 23:39.480
If you call for someone,

23:39.640 --> 23:40.550
it's not just me,

23:40.600 --> 23:41.750
you'll be in danger too.

23:42.680 --> 23:43.680
Trust me this once.

23:44.140 --> 23:45.300
I won't harm you.

24:13.080 --> 24:14.160
As expected.

24:41.540 --> 24:43.640
[Wushuang Society]

24:47.720 --> 24:48.750
Do you understand now?

24:49.270 --> 24:50.720
There's no need for me to explain, is there?

24:54.240 --> 24:55.350
You'd better explain anyway.

24:56.880 --> 24:58.200
The reason I conducted a night investigation

24:58.510 --> 24:59.310
was because I received

24:59.310 --> 25:00.400
a tip from Jiuguang.

25:01.350 --> 25:03.030
In his pursuit of the cause of Lyu Yao's death,

25:03.480 --> 25:05.200
he had been closely monitoring the Green Garden Trading House.

25:05.830 --> 25:07.160
Following the trail,

25:07.510 --> 25:08.240
he rescued someone

25:08.240 --> 25:09.790
who was nearly silenced.

25:10.240 --> 25:11.750
That person mentioned a token,

25:12.270 --> 25:13.550
and the origin of this token

25:14.200 --> 25:15.590
pointed to the City Lord's Mansion.

25:16.510 --> 25:18.400
So when you said you wanted to stay for a couple more days,

25:19.000 --> 25:20.440
it was to find this token?

25:20.750 --> 25:21.550
Yes.

25:22.510 --> 25:23.440
I wasn't sure before

25:23.440 --> 25:24.510
if I could find it in one attempt.

25:25.240 --> 25:27.000
Unexpectedly, my luck was quite good.

25:29.400 --> 25:30.960
Now, with concrete evidence in hand,

25:31.790 --> 25:33.160
it seems that the murderer who killed Lyu Yao

25:33.440 --> 25:34.350
and the mastermind behind

25:34.350 --> 25:35.750
the Wushuang Society

25:36.550 --> 25:38.030
are both your brother.

25:45.350 --> 25:47.440
The Wushuang Society has been deeply embedded in Yandu for a long time.

25:47.920 --> 25:49.510
This organization acts radically,

25:50.070 --> 25:51.590
viewing the Youhu Clan as their enemy

25:52.000 --> 25:53.440
and the War Demon Clan as their friend.

25:54.440 --> 25:55.830
They secretly support the Green Garden Trading House

25:55.830 --> 25:57.070
among many other trading houses

25:57.070 --> 25:58.480
to trade with War Demons.

25:59.790 --> 26:01.110
Not just raw stones,

26:01.680 --> 26:03.680
but also large quantities of daily supplies are involved.

26:03.790 --> 26:05.110
It can be said that they have been consistently supporting

26:05.110 --> 26:06.790
War Demons, keeping them alive despite setbacks.

26:08.350 --> 26:09.830
It's like a malignant tumor

26:09.830 --> 26:10.960
that stirs up chaos in this world.

26:12.440 --> 26:13.880
I just never imagined

26:14.750 --> 26:18.590
that this tumor would actually grow in the heart of Yandu,

26:19.070 --> 26:20.590
right here in the City Lord's Mansion.

26:22.200 --> 26:24.640
Isn't it too hasty to conclude

26:24.640 --> 26:26.240
that Zhi Yue is the mastermind

26:26.400 --> 26:27.720
based solely on this item?

26:28.440 --> 26:29.640
Given his status,

26:29.830 --> 26:31.240
how could he be subordinate to others?

26:31.920 --> 26:33.550
If he is part of the Wushuang Society,

26:33.830 --> 26:35.270
he must be the leader of evil.

26:36.270 --> 26:37.070
What if he's not

26:37.070 --> 26:38.270
a member of the Wushuang Society?

26:38.960 --> 26:40.480
Although this item was found in his possession,

26:40.720 --> 26:42.480
it doesn't prove that it belongs to him.

26:43.680 --> 26:45.510
Perhaps Zhi Yue is also investigating this matter,

26:45.790 --> 26:46.640
and the token

26:46.680 --> 26:48.240
is evidence he found during his search?

26:50.160 --> 26:52.920
Do you even believe what you said yourself?

26:56.350 --> 26:57.160
Alright.

26:58.100 --> 26:59.490
This is a serious issue.

26:59.880 --> 27:01.510
I know it's hard for you to accept right now.

27:02.270 --> 27:03.350
I'll give you time.

27:05.270 --> 27:06.960
I'll leave the City Lord's Mansion right away.

27:07.550 --> 27:09.350
I'll give you three days to think it over,

27:09.920 --> 27:11.800
and I won't report this to the clan for now.

27:13.720 --> 27:14.550
In three days,

27:15.310 --> 27:17.070
we'll discuss this matter together again.

27:18.590 --> 27:20.110
I hope by then, you'll come to your senses

27:20.440 --> 27:21.760
and no longer show bias towards him.

27:26.080 --> 27:27.120
As for this tumor,

27:28.200 --> 27:29.830
we of the Youhu Clan must

27:29.830 --> 27:31.030
remove it at all costs.

27:56.440 --> 27:57.920
Ji Tanyin considers you a friend.

27:58.270 --> 27:59.360
Even if you're leaving,

27:59.550 --> 28:00.240
you should

28:00.240 --> 28:01.590
at least have said goodbye to her.

28:01.960 --> 28:02.880
It's none of your business.

28:03.160 --> 28:04.070
I owe her,

28:04.070 --> 28:05.160
but I don't owe you anything.

28:11.920 --> 28:13.240
Don't push me too far.

28:14.890 --> 28:16.260
So what if I do?

28:24.310 --> 28:25.920
Times have changed.

28:26.270 --> 28:27.200
If you get hurt now,

28:27.580 --> 28:29.100
it won't be so easy to recover.

28:29.160 --> 28:30.350
I know about you.

28:30.550 --> 28:31.400
You're a demon.

28:31.690 --> 28:32.780
You can't fool me,

28:33.070 --> 28:34.070
and you certainly can't fool her!

28:34.640 --> 28:35.510
Then tell me,

28:36.030 --> 28:38.960
what do you think I plan to do by getting close to her?

28:39.590 --> 28:41.030
Or let me rephrase,

28:41.590 --> 28:43.350
even if I deceive her and harm her,

28:43.800 --> 28:44.950
what can you do about it?

28:45.110 --> 28:46.880
I'll fight you to the death if I have to!

28:48.640 --> 28:50.750
They say War Demons are naturally combative.

28:51.030 --> 28:52.880
It seems to be true in your case.

28:53.440 --> 28:55.030
But with your magic source destroyed,

28:55.160 --> 28:56.750
how do you plan to fight me to the death?

28:56.750 --> 28:58.510
I'll bite you to death if I have to!

28:58.830 --> 28:59.640
Is that so?

29:25.820 --> 29:27.770
Seems your teeth aren't very sharp.

29:30.200 --> 29:31.240
You're asking for death!

29:39.750 --> 29:40.960
You used such dirty tricks!

29:41.270 --> 29:43.030
You scoundrel! You lowlife!

29:43.030 --> 29:43.750
Let go!

29:53.920 --> 29:54.710
You...

29:56.200 --> 29:57.200
What are you doing?

29:58.550 --> 30:00.000
I'm watching you play dumb.

30:00.440 --> 30:01.550
Do you really not know

30:01.550 --> 30:02.750
what I'm doing?

30:04.110 --> 30:05.110
Why are you helping me?

30:05.590 --> 30:06.750
Reach the utmost emptiness,

30:07.310 --> 30:08.680
and maintain unwavering tranquility.

30:09.160 --> 30:10.440
Let the mind dwell on nothing,

30:10.800 --> 30:12.160
and the breath flow naturally.

30:12.700 --> 30:15.550
Only then can your skills flow endlessly.

30:17.680 --> 30:18.750
You still haven't answered.

30:19.200 --> 30:20.270
Why are you helping me?

30:21.720 --> 30:23.070
Because you're lucky.

30:23.830 --> 30:25.070
I don't like you,

30:25.350 --> 30:26.830
but she does.

30:27.790 --> 30:29.400
That's your luck.

30:38.790 --> 30:39.590
By the way,

30:39.870 --> 30:41.660
when I get to Xue's house tomorrow,

30:41.850 --> 30:43.440
I'll expect you there.

30:44.030 --> 30:44.830
Otherwise...

30:57.000 --> 30:57.790
Mr. Loong.

30:58.480 --> 30:59.270
Mr. Loong.

31:30.290 --> 31:31.580
What exactly happened?

31:32.000 --> 31:32.960
Could it be that Hannv

31:32.960 --> 31:34.240
has closed the Ascension Platform?

31:35.400 --> 31:36.200
Then I

31:36.470 --> 31:38.030
won't be able to ascend to heaven, will I?

32:01.000 --> 32:01.790
Tanyin.

32:05.080 --> 32:05.790
Good morning.

32:05.880 --> 32:07.110
You're up so early today.

32:08.440 --> 32:10.350
I've made some astragalus and cinnamon soup.

32:10.460 --> 32:11.260
Have some later.

32:11.280 --> 32:12.280
It'll nourish your blood and qi.

32:12.550 --> 32:13.350
Are you hungry?

32:13.350 --> 32:14.440
Do you want to eat something?

32:14.440 --> 32:15.070
No, thank you.

32:15.070 --> 32:16.160
Let me help you.

32:16.160 --> 32:17.270
It's quite boring just sitting here anyways.

32:17.270 --> 32:18.200
No need.

32:18.470 --> 32:20.270
I don't need your help.

32:20.310 --> 32:21.720
If you're bored,

32:22.270 --> 32:23.550
why don't you read for a while?

32:23.550 --> 32:24.720
I'll get back to work.

32:38.600 --> 32:41.180
[City Lord's Mansion]

32:41.950 --> 32:42.760
Useless!

32:43.140 --> 32:44.540
A bunch of useless fools!

32:44.860 --> 32:45.580
Is my study

32:45.610 --> 32:47.320
some kind of public tavern?

32:47.550 --> 32:49.070
That thief just came and went as he pleased,

32:49.070 --> 32:50.010
without any hindrance.

32:50.160 --> 32:52.160
What are you all good for?

32:53.930 --> 32:55.170
Get out, all of you!

32:55.580 --> 32:56.380
Search!

32:56.920 --> 32:58.240
Turn everything upside down!

32:58.720 --> 32:59.750
Before nightfall,

32:59.830 --> 33:01.830
if you don't find that thief,

33:01.990 --> 33:04.270
I'll have you all beheaded!

33:04.510 --> 33:05.310
Get out!

33:05.480 --> 33:06.270
Yes, My Lord.

33:07.630 --> 33:08.550
Young Mistress! Young Mistress!

33:08.570 --> 33:09.280
Make way!

33:15.160 --> 33:15.960
Dai.

33:16.720 --> 33:18.640
I know where that item you are looking for is.

33:18.910 --> 33:20.020
Let's talk in private.

33:24.000 --> 33:25.720
I've been busy with official matters lately

33:26.070 --> 33:27.200
and haven't had time

33:27.750 --> 33:29.790
to come and have a good talk with you, Dai.

33:29.970 --> 33:31.010
I've been remiss in my manners.

33:31.510 --> 33:32.640
It's all my fault.

33:32.790 --> 33:33.750
Your fault

33:34.160 --> 33:35.290
isn't about manners.

33:37.350 --> 33:38.880
Dai, you've been away from home for a long time.

33:39.200 --> 33:41.610
The current situation in this city is not what it used to be.

33:41.900 --> 33:43.860
It's understandable if you can't comprehend it.

33:43.890 --> 33:45.370
Do you really think I can't comprehend it?

33:46.030 --> 33:47.960
You're supporting the Wushuang Society to do evil.

33:48.480 --> 33:50.110
I see it very clearly.

33:51.090 --> 33:52.530
You're mistaken.

33:53.340 --> 33:54.140
Good and evil

33:54.510 --> 33:56.080
cannot be summed up so simply.

33:56.760 --> 33:58.240
Father is already old.

33:58.270 --> 33:59.560
As his son,

33:59.580 --> 34:01.730
I'm merely sharing his burdens.

34:02.710 --> 34:04.560
You speak so righteously.

34:05.680 --> 34:07.510
Is this how you share his burdens?

34:08.400 --> 34:09.280
What else?

34:09.920 --> 34:11.280
The Youhu Clan leads all clans,

34:11.280 --> 34:12.480
standing high above.

34:12.520 --> 34:14.250
The War Demons are watching covetously,

34:14.280 --> 34:15.400
lying in wait on the side.

34:15.480 --> 34:17.590
I'm merely diverting the danger,

34:17.590 --> 34:19.440
letting the two clans check each other's power.

34:19.880 --> 34:20.960
If not for this,

34:21.030 --> 34:23.670
how could we, the human race, survive in the cracks

34:23.670 --> 34:24.920
and wait for our chance to rise?

34:26.639 --> 34:27.560
In terms of lifespan,

34:27.830 --> 34:29.350
we of the human race are no match for the other two clans.

34:29.670 --> 34:30.400
When it comes to strength,

34:30.400 --> 34:32.230
we humans are even more vulnerable.

34:33.360 --> 34:34.840
Dai, I have long seen through this.

34:34.840 --> 34:36.360
Only by widely promoting craftsmanship,

34:36.400 --> 34:37.590
having more children born,

34:37.590 --> 34:39.440
and causing constant conflicts between the other two races,

34:39.440 --> 34:40.670
leaving them no time for other matters,

34:41.290 --> 34:43.929
can we humans have a way to survive

34:44.600 --> 34:45.810
and have a future.

34:46.150 --> 34:47.030
A way to survive?

34:48.360 --> 34:50.360
Since you know well how strong the other two clans are,

34:50.360 --> 34:51.000
do you realize

34:51.000 --> 34:52.389
that this path of survival you're paving

34:52.480 --> 34:54.139
will be covered with blood and corpses?

34:55.320 --> 34:57.590
Dai, why show such womanly kindness?

34:57.790 --> 34:59.420
Since ancient times, the struggle for supremacy

34:59.510 --> 35:01.190
has inevitably led to rivers of blood.

35:01.440 --> 35:02.400
Without sacrifice,

35:02.510 --> 35:04.000
how can we achieve peace?

35:04.000 --> 35:05.670
Isn't it peaceful now?

35:05.670 --> 35:06.840
The human race is declining.

35:06.930 --> 35:07.600
If this continues,

35:07.630 --> 35:09.070
do you think it will remain peaceful?

35:10.510 --> 35:11.320
The current situation

35:12.170 --> 35:13.650
is not the peace I desire.

35:14.150 --> 35:15.670
No matter what kind of peace it is,

35:16.590 --> 35:19.070
those who disrupt peace will suffer the consequences.

35:19.840 --> 35:21.510
Zhi Yue, you're playing with fire.

35:21.590 --> 35:23.480
I'm only worried that this fire isn't burning fiercely

35:23.480 --> 35:24.590
and intensely enough!

35:26.030 --> 35:26.840
Dai.

35:27.000 --> 35:28.400
After Father takes the pill,

35:28.400 --> 35:30.190
he'll regain his youth just like you did, right?

35:30.400 --> 35:31.150
When that time comes,

35:31.150 --> 35:32.470
let's go persuade him together.

35:32.470 --> 35:34.510
He will surely understand the reasoning behind this.

35:35.320 --> 35:36.110
At that time,

35:36.300 --> 35:37.780
with us siblings united,

35:37.880 --> 35:40.470
we'll assist Father in achieving unprecedented feats.

35:40.890 --> 35:42.290
For thousands of years to come,

35:42.440 --> 35:43.760
our names will go down in history.

35:43.960 --> 35:45.110
This way, it won't be in vain for us to have come to this world

35:45.110 --> 35:46.480
and lived this life.

35:48.000 --> 35:48.800
Of course,

35:49.800 --> 35:51.200
since I don't have any pill to take,

35:51.590 --> 35:53.320
I naturally won't live as long as you and Father.

35:53.640 --> 35:55.080
Therefore, in future history books,

35:55.110 --> 35:57.030
the focus will surely be on you and Father,

35:57.230 --> 35:58.710
with great emphasis.

35:59.150 --> 36:00.960
And if the opportunity arises in the future,

36:01.960 --> 36:03.230
perhaps, Dai,

36:03.590 --> 36:05.800
you could also take charge

36:07.040 --> 36:08.680
and rule over all.

36:08.840 --> 36:09.630
Shut up!

36:11.030 --> 36:12.030
Have you gone mad?

36:12.880 --> 36:14.360
Father has struggled his entire life

36:14.360 --> 36:16.150
just for all races to coexist peacefully.

36:16.710 --> 36:17.760
As for your ambitious

36:17.760 --> 36:19.320
and bloody dream,

36:19.360 --> 36:20.480
you'd better wake up before it's too late!

36:27.110 --> 36:28.320
Dai, your admonition is right.

36:29.180 --> 36:30.260
I was foolish.

36:30.550 --> 36:31.360
I am guilty.

36:31.630 --> 36:33.400
I'll order the dissolution of the Wushuang Society immediately.

36:33.840 --> 36:34.510
I'll put an end to my

36:34.510 --> 36:35.840
unrealistic ideas.

36:36.710 --> 36:37.550
But Dai,

36:37.620 --> 36:38.620
please don't

36:38.640 --> 36:39.690
tell Father about this.

36:40.000 --> 36:41.670
You know Father's temper.

36:42.150 --> 36:43.150
If he finds out,

36:43.920 --> 36:45.440
he surely won't spare me.

36:45.760 --> 36:46.630
It's too late.

36:47.160 --> 36:49.000
Mr. Tanghua already knows about this.

36:49.190 --> 36:50.840
He will surely report it to the Youhu Clan.

36:51.550 --> 36:52.630
The cat's out of the bag.

36:52.930 --> 36:54.440
Father will find out sooner or later.

36:55.760 --> 36:57.070
That must not happen, Dai.

37:01.030 --> 37:01.840
Dai.

37:03.030 --> 37:04.280
Please. You must find a way

37:04.280 --> 37:05.230
to save me.

37:06.590 --> 37:07.670
If you don't want to face Father's

37:07.670 --> 37:08.710
thunderous rage,

37:08.960 --> 37:11.000
I advise you to take the initiative to confess.

37:11.590 --> 37:12.800
As soon as Father comes out of seclusion,

37:12.800 --> 37:14.480
tell him everything

37:14.500 --> 37:15.710
and sincerely repent.

37:17.080 --> 37:18.480
There will surely be punishment,

37:18.880 --> 37:20.150
but considering you turn yourself in,

37:20.510 --> 37:22.070
Father will surely spare your life.

37:27.230 --> 37:28.630
Father will be out of seclusion soon.

37:29.190 --> 37:31.140
Will you tell him yourself or should I,

37:31.480 --> 37:33.320
or should we wait until it's exposed

37:33.320 --> 37:34.880
and let the Youhu Clan tell him?

37:35.880 --> 37:37.280
I advise you to weigh your options carefully.

38:01.040 --> 38:01.850
Xue.

38:03.000 --> 38:04.190
High Priest, you're here.

38:04.630 --> 38:06.320
I just bought two chickens from the market.

38:06.320 --> 38:07.560
I'll make chicken soup for everyone later.

38:07.580 --> 38:08.710
Here, let me take them.

38:08.920 --> 38:09.840
Here are some dried apricots too.

38:09.840 --> 38:10.550
Thank you.

38:11.800 --> 38:12.880
Hurry up and go inside.

38:12.880 --> 38:14.030
Tanyin must be very happy.

38:14.030 --> 38:15.640
She's been saying she's bored since early this morning.

38:30.110 --> 38:30.920
Qian Lin.

38:31.110 --> 38:32.280
Go check in the kitchen quickly

38:32.280 --> 38:33.110
to see if the medicinal soup for Tanyin

38:33.110 --> 38:34.000
is ready.

38:41.400 --> 38:42.190
Good morning.

38:42.800 --> 38:43.710
What are you reading?

38:44.320 --> 38:45.110
Take a look.

38:48.360 --> 38:50.360
"There is a square pond, about 3 meters wide,

38:50.710 --> 38:52.800
with a reed growing in its center,

38:52.800 --> 38:54.480
which extends about 30 centimeters above the water.

38:54.630 --> 38:56.000
When the reed is pulled to the shore,

38:56.230 --> 38:57.480
it just reaches the edge.

38:57.840 --> 38:59.630
The question is, what is the depth of the water,

38:59.760 --> 39:01.590
and how long is the reed?“

39:04.630 --> 39:07.710
”There's a skilled walker and an unskilled walker. In the time it takes the skilled one to walk 100 steps,

39:07.710 --> 39:09.880
the unskilled one can walk 60 steps.

39:09.880 --> 39:12.960
Now, the unskilled walker starts 100 steps ahead,

39:13.010 --> 39:14.780
and the skilled walker chases after him.

39:15.070 --> 39:17.840
The question is, how many steps will it take for him to catch up?"

39:27.000 --> 39:27.800
This is...

39:28.190 --> 39:29.230
This is an arithmetic book I found

39:29.230 --> 39:29.710
in the

39:29.710 --> 39:31.400
original owner's cabinet.

39:32.280 --> 39:33.670
It should be for little children.

39:33.670 --> 39:34.920
You can't understand it, can you?

39:35.200 --> 39:36.400
It's for children?

39:39.230 --> 39:40.320
Isn't it very difficult?

39:41.440 --> 39:42.320
Not really.

39:43.670 --> 39:45.150
The human race has too many books.

39:45.150 --> 39:47.030
I don't specifically read arithmetic books.

39:47.400 --> 39:48.190
I know.

39:52.250 --> 39:54.040
I've read many other books too.

39:54.110 --> 39:54.880
Yes, yes.

39:54.880 --> 39:55.920
I know.

40:01.250 --> 40:02.600
Is it really for children?

40:04.360 --> 40:05.800
The curriculum of you human race

40:05.800 --> 40:06.880
is too difficult.

40:07.440 --> 40:08.230
Indeed.

40:08.400 --> 40:10.850
It's not easy for the little ones, either.

40:16.100 --> 40:17.140
What happened to your sleeve?

40:18.000 --> 40:19.030
I went out today

40:19.030 --> 40:19.920
to buy some things.

40:20.150 --> 40:22.280
It might have been scratched by a cage.

40:22.280 --> 40:23.150
It's not a big deal.

40:23.400 --> 40:24.070
So, can I

40:24.070 --> 40:25.760
go out for a walk today?

40:26.190 --> 40:28.150
Xue said you're deficient in qi and blood.

40:28.510 --> 40:29.840
Yet you're thinking about going for a walk on the street?

40:30.030 --> 40:31.110
Take your medicine first.

40:32.070 --> 40:33.360
Can I go out after I finish it?

40:33.360 --> 40:34.360
Not necessarily.

40:34.360 --> 40:35.400
But if you don't take it,

40:35.400 --> 40:36.840
you definitely can't go out.

40:46.360 --> 40:47.150
Is it bitter?

40:47.360 --> 40:48.150
Yes, it is.

40:48.340 --> 40:49.780
Then why don't I see you frowning?

40:50.070 --> 40:50.880
I can still bear it.

40:52.150 --> 40:52.960
Here.

40:59.930 --> 41:00.890
It's so sour.

41:02.230 --> 41:03.280
This I can't bear.

41:05.110 --> 41:05.920
Alright.

41:06.230 --> 41:07.510
Although you can't go out on the street,

41:07.710 --> 41:09.550
you can still get some fresh air

41:09.550 --> 41:10.590
in the courtyard.

41:11.230 --> 41:12.510
Are you going back on your word?

41:15.510 --> 41:16.760
I can walk by myself.

41:17.030 --> 41:18.400
Don't drop me.

41:42.280 --> 41:43.070
Qian Lin.

41:43.360 --> 41:44.320
You've recovered?

41:45.080 --> 41:46.810
Did you help him restore his magic source?

41:47.880 --> 41:49.360
Who else could it be if not me?

41:49.550 --> 41:50.550
Do you think he can grow another magic source

41:50.550 --> 41:51.710
like growing a tooth?

41:52.920 --> 41:53.850
Alright, alright.

41:54.110 --> 41:55.070
Go practice outside.

41:55.230 --> 41:56.030
Look what you've done

41:56.030 --> 41:57.210
to this courtyard.

41:57.550 --> 41:58.360
Alright.

41:58.510 --> 41:59.800
He wasn't so submissive to you before

41:59.800 --> 42:00.880
as he is now.

42:00.880 --> 42:02.150
How could it be the same?

42:02.550 --> 42:04.030
I used to be his enemy.

42:04.110 --> 42:05.110
Now I'm his...

42:07.760 --> 42:08.440
Never mind.

42:08.440 --> 42:09.960
It's better to remain his enemy.

42:24.440 --> 42:25.230
Xue alone

42:25.230 --> 42:26.360
has to take care of both of you.

42:26.560 --> 42:27.960
It's really not easy.

42:28.920 --> 42:30.400
She's a very good person.

42:30.470 --> 42:31.680
I cherish her very much.

42:32.580 --> 42:34.580
You can say nice things to my face.

42:34.760 --> 42:36.000
Saying them behind my back,

42:36.000 --> 42:37.400
I won't be able to hear them.

42:39.550 --> 42:40.480
Who did this?

42:41.000 --> 42:42.070
Don't tell me you three

42:42.070 --> 42:43.760
had a fight while I was away!

42:44.150 --> 42:45.550
I can't possibly beat those two.

42:46.710 --> 42:47.510
Qian Lin.

42:47.810 --> 42:49.000
It must have been Qian Lin.

42:49.070 --> 42:50.800
He always has a problem with my flowers.

42:50.840 --> 42:51.710
Perhaps this place of yours

42:51.710 --> 42:52.920
has a conflict with the wood element.

42:53.440 --> 42:54.920
Why don't I help you turn it into a fish pond?

42:55.440 --> 42:56.230
Where is he?
